{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27235","headline":"鹰 · 章孝标","name":"鹰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"星眸未放瞥秋毫，频掣金铃试雪毛。\n会使老拳供口腹，莫辞亲手啖腥臊。\n穿云自怪身如电，煞兔谁知吻胜刀。\n可惜忍饥寒日暮，向人鵮断碧丝縧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27235.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27235","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}